DESCRIPTION:A new play based on G.K. Chesterton's The Innocence of Father B
	rown Written by Patrick Rieger Directed by Jay Muldoon Stage Manager: Rose
	 Gibson Step into an intimate theatrical experience unlike any other as Th
	e Angelico Project presents its first-ever Black Box Theatre production. D
	ebuting in the Aronoff Center's Fifth Third Bank Theater\, Father Brown — 
	based on the beloved stories of G.K. Chesterton — follows a humble Catholi
	c priest whose deep understanding of human nature enables him to solve mys
	teries that confound everyone else. This immersive production brings audie
