UID:1df72e9d4c072b498086c0cb
SUMMARY:CON MAN: A True Crime Magic Show
DTSTAMP:20260905T080357Z
DTSTART:20270306T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:a { text-decoration: none\; color: #464feb\; } tr th\, tr td { 
	border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\; } tr th { background-color: #f5f5f5\; } CON MA
	N is a hilarious and mind-blowing dive into the world of deception. Magici
	an Ben Seidman (Netflix\, Vanity Fair\, Now You See Me) will pick your poc
	kets\, read your mind\, and make you question what is a trick and what is 
	real. CON MAN is a one-man theatrical experience that blends sleight of ha
	nd\, storytelling\, and stand up comedy. Every performance is unique. Ever
	y audience becomes part of the story. From card sharps to swindlers\, CON 
	MAN brings the art of deception to life right before your eyes. Don’t miss
	 this truly astonishing and unique magic show from the viral sensation as 
	seen on Vanderpump Rules\, WIRED\, and Penn & Teller: Fool Us. Grab your t
	ickets before the show becomes illegal.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/
	events/detail/con-man
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/con-man
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Other
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
